				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xplkqlkcassia" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2846155); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2846155&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606014670" alt="xplkqlkcassia" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2846155)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xplkqlkcassia" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2846155); return false;" >xplkqlkcassia</a></span> <span class="odate time_1498177234 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">23 Jun 2017 00:20</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2890575">
									

<p>Soooo this has been in the works for five months – it’s my my first actual skip and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/preface-to-practical-logopsychology">my second article on the mainlist</a>! Thank you to the kind people who critted this on the forums and on Reddit, your input made this article much better!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I’ve left a number of things deliberately ambiguous, but I can say that:</p>
<ul>
<li>The Archivists are involved with archiving the multiverse. They preserve low-entropy objects (such as technology and biological organisms) from the heat deaths of universes.</li>
</ul>
<p>If there’s anything you found confusing, or you anythng you think needs more fleshing out, please mention it here!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>All resources are mine, except those listed here:</p>
<ol>
<li>Logashkino is <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Abandoned_factory,_Railway_Tulcea-Medgidia_01.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Abandoned_factory,_Railway_Tulcea-Medgidia_01.jpg</a></li>
<li>The paper texture is <a href="http://bashcorpo.deviantart.com/art/Grungy-paper-texture-v-8-37941453">http://bashcorpo.deviantart.com/art/Grungy-paper-texture-v-8-37941453</a></li>
<li>The laboratory background is <a href="https://www.bnl.gov/newsroom/news.php?a=111523">https://www.bnl.gov/newsroom/news.php?a=111523</a> (<a href="https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Wikilegal/Copyright_Status_Of_Images_Hosted_On_US_Government_Websites">https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Wikilegal/Copyright_Status_Of_Images_Hosted_On_US_Government_Websites</a>)</li>
<li>The Chinese logo is <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ministry_of_State_Security_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ministry_of_State_Security_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg</a></li>
<li>The trendy cube-building for Site-62 is <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Montreal_-_QC_-_Habitat67.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Montreal_-_QC_-_Habitat67.jpg</a></li>
<li>The guy with his eyes blacked out is from a b&amp;w photo of Sean Connery, I wasn’t able to find the original creator, but I will remove it if need be.</li>
<li>The alien font used in the last section is called “Alien font”, and I got it from a guy on /r/deepdream (<a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/deepdream/comments/5k92bg/my_holiday_gift_to_rdeepdream_3_free_fonts/?ref=search_posts">https://www.reddit.com/r/deepdream/comments/5k92bg/my_holiday_gift_to_rdeepdream_3_free_fonts/?ref=search_posts</a>)</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Also all of the images here are hosted in imgur, I couldn’t figure out how to upload them on the sandbox, so I’ll try and upload as many as possible.</span> (all done now!)</p>
<p>Edit: just to add some context for why this article goes a little nuts on formatting and multimedia, one of the ideas which I had early on in writing this was to make something that had elements of an SCP document and elements of a tale – I'm not sure if I was successful in blending them together, but in any case I'm unbelievably happy to have my first skip upvoted (at the time of writing) to +70! :D</p>

							</div>

								
